<div><label for="directStemFiles">MP3 / WAV stems (optional)</label><input id="directStemFiles" type="file" accept=".mp3,.wav,audio/mpeg,audio/wav,audio/x-wav" multiple><small>Select up to 96 stems. Project file is required on this page.</small></div></div>
